 ],
 "caption": "HubSpot replaced its CEO on Nov 12 and brought back co-founder Brian Halligan, five years after he stepped down. It came about a month after the company cut roughly 600 jobs, and HubSpot called the move a \"refounding\" as it reworks the business around AI agents.\n\nFor a small business the lesson is quiet: a tool you rent can change direction on its own schedule. Use the tools, but keep your website, domain and customer list somewhere you control.\n\nIs your website and customer list yours, or rented? DM us the word OWN and we'll look at it with you.\n\n#moodbod #websitedevelopment #smallbusinessnamibia #windhoek #automation\n\nSources: Inc, PYMNTS, The Next Web, CMSWire, Finimize (Nov 12, 2026)."
